    osType : str, default is Undefined, optional
        Proxmox OS type (e.g. l26 for Linux 2.6+/3.x).
    pool : str, default is Undefined, optional
        Resource pool id (poolId).
    rebootAfterUpdate : bool, default is Undefined, optional
        Let the provider shut the VM down and start it again when
        an update needs it (bpg `reboot_after_update`, whose own
        default is true). Off by default: with it on, any field a
        NEW provider version reads as changed reboots the VM
